 crucial role in metabolism and muscular function in particular.</p><br><p>Whether you're looking to stay focused throughout your workday, aiming to hit that next level in a workout, or you need more energy to enjoy time with friends and family, creatine can support you across all of your goals.</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="940f6a59-669b-4c22-bb20-099067a24b10" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1qs60yq"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_HowDoesCreatineWork_WhiteBG-min.png?v=1740954741&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_HowDoesCreatineWork_WhiteBG-min.png?v=1740954741&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_HowDoesCreatineWork_WhiteBG-min.png?v=1740954741&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_HowDoesCreatineWork_WhiteBG-min.png?v=1740954741" alt="Infographic explaining how creatine works in energy and muscle recovery." class="r-31fizr" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="60c0d31d-6993-4e6f-a4be-c8de663726c1" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" class="r-gy66jw"><div data-rid="a15fdb43-dd7e-42e5-aa10-2aec9bbba858" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-u3fly"><div data-rid="eb95a7ad-7d6d-4747-81c1-b06bd4718e7c" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-x2kndq"><div class="r-1mbpd4l"><video style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:var(--rof, inherit);object-position:var(--rop, inherit)" preload="metadata" autoplay="" muted="" loop=""></video></div></div></div><div data-rid="e0731a50-396b-4c87-86d5-55fae29d61b0" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1ocn71z"><div data-rid="00a33ea6-9049-456e-8292-32194e04013e" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1ovldx4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>2. Proper supplementation can help increase strength without bulk.</p></span></div><div data-rid="f979c347-2d99-481b-92cb-b942f116babe" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-3q53zj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>One of the most common misconceptions around creatine is that it's used solely by bodybuilders looking to get huge. In fact, creatine is highly associated with the development of lean muscle. </p><br><p>Creatine also facilitates exercises associated with building lean, toned muscle like high-energy interval training (HIIT) and endurance sports, along with the more traditional weightlifting efforts.</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="e9a3260b-af0b-48cd-befe-4742f52c1ada" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="influencers" tabindex="-1" id="influencers" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1ovmhpm"><div data-rid="8308ba5e-e8a9-467a-8fc8-03be1ba981de" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1ndkl6a"><div data-rid="1d6dbe0f-2561-4b0f-a77c-900339ea64fa" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1jia7sj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>3. Speeds up recovery and reduces soreness.</p></span></div><div data-rid="9c010628-dd8f-45e9-81ad-d09b41db8cdc" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1c9otg4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>It can be hard enough to fit going to the gym in a busy schedule, but it's especially difficult if you're sore and dragging after a hard workout. </p><p>Creatine has been shown to help reduce muscle inflammation and soreness, helping you bounce back more quickly.</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="f3e13c09-89bf-42f8-9db6-995128c2de08" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1q6p19k"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Image_6_1_49669bd9-d833-4c99-9a8f-c931f4cc88b1.jpg?v=1740955337&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopif